DESCRIPTION:This listing is for our Introduction to Ravelry Course. The cl
 asses will be held in person at Bistitchual on Sunday August 23rd from 3:0
 0pm - 4:00pm. Can’t seem to find free patterns? Looking for inspiration 
 for that special yarn? Losing track of your WIPs? Sign up for our Intro to
  Ravelry class! Learn how to navigate the world’s largest knitting and c
 rochet pattern database\, track your projects\, and see others’ worg! In
  this class you will learn how to search the database using the ‘Advance
 d Search’ function\, how to use ‘My Notebook’ to keep track of proje
 cts\, stash\, and tools\, as well as an introduction to the Ravelry Forums
 . All you need to do is sign up for a free account\, and come ready to lea
 rn! >>Please bring a laptop or tablet device that can access the Internet 
 to follow along as we explore Ravelry. Cancellation Policy Classes must be
